## 10. BINARY TO UNPACKED BCD
Question:
M[8500H] contains a binary number from 00H to 63H (0–99 decimal).
Store tens digit at 8501H and units digit at 8502H.

```asm
        LDA 8500H
        MVI B, 00H

TENLOOP:
        CPI 0AH
        JC DONE_TENS
        SUI 0AH
        INR B
        JMP TENLOOP

DONE_TENS:
        MOV C, A
        MOV A, B
        STA 8501H
        MOV A, C
        STA 8502H
        HLT
```

## 11. SORT N NUMBERS IN ASCENDING ORDER
Question:
M[8000H] contains N. N elements start at 8001H.
Sort in ascending order in place.

```asm
        LDA 8000H
        MOV B, A
        DCR B

OUTER:  MOV C, B
        LXI H, 8001H

INNER:  MOV A, M
        INX H
        MOV E, M
        CMP E
        JC NOSWAP

        MOV M, A
        DCX H
        MOV M, E
        INX H

NOSWAP: DCR C
        JNZ INNER

        DCR B
        JNZ OUTER
        HLT
```

## 12. FIBONACCI SERIES
Question:
M[8000H] contains N. Generate N Fibonacci terms and store from 8001H.

```asm
        LDA 8000H
        MOV C, A

        MVI A, 00H
        STA 8001H
        DCR C
        JZ END

        MVI A, 01H
        STA 8002H
        DCR C
        JZ END

        LXI H, 8001H

NEXT:   MOV A, M
        INX H
        MOV B, M
        INX H
        ADD B
        MOV M, A
        DCR C
        JNZ NEXT

END:    HLT
```

## 13. CHECK WHETHER A NUMBER IS PRIME
Question:
Input at 8200H. Store 01H at 8201H if prime, otherwise 00H.

```asm
        LDA 8200H
        MOV B, A

        CPI 02H
        JC NOTPRIME
        CPI 02H
        JZ PRIME

        MVI C, 02H

CHKDIV: MOV A, B
        CMP C
        JZ PRIME

        MOV A, B

MODLP:  SUB C
        JC NEXTDIV
        JNZ MODLP
        JMP NOTPRIME

NEXTDIV:
        INR C
        JMP CHKDIV

PRIME:  MVI A, 01H
        STA 8201H
        HLT

NOTPRIME:
        MVI A, 00H
        STA 8201H
        HLT
```

## 14. ROTATE AN 8-BIT NUMBER
Question:
Input at 8600H. Perform RLC and store result at 8601H.

```asm
        LDA 8600H
        RLC
        STA 8601H
        HLT
```

Other rotate instructions:
RLC = rotate left
RRC = rotate right
RAL = rotate left through carry
RAR = rotate right through carry

