## 24. ROTATE EXAMPLES

```asm
        LDA 8600H
        RLC
        STA 8601H
        HLT
```

RLC:
A7 -> CY and A0

RRC:
A0 -> CY and A7

RAL:
A7 -> CY and old CY -> A0

RAR:
A0 -> CY and old CY -> A7

## 25. CONDITIONAL JUMP EXAMPLES

```asm
        JPO 9000H        ; Jump if parity odd, P=0
        JPE 9000H        ; Jump if parity even, P=1
        JM  9000H        ; Jump if minus, S=1
        JP  9000H        ; Jump if plus, S=0
        JZ  9000H        ; Jump if zero, Z=1
        JNZ 9000H        ; Jump if not zero, Z=0
        JC  9000H        ; Jump if carry, CY=1
        JNC 9000H        ; Jump if no carry, CY=0